coupling unification, proton decay or magnetic monopoles.\n\nInherited theorem and branch proof: https://unified-dynamics-public.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/papers/#critical-bifurcation-v01 . The current theorem is conditional on its local stationary-sheet hypotheses.\n"
